                  </a>\r\n                                        </li>\r\n                                        <li class=\"d-inline-block\">\r\n                                            <a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                                                <i class=\"flaticon-instagram\"></i>\r\n                                            </a>\r\n                                        </li>\r\n                                        <li class=\"d-inline-block\">\r\n                                            <a class=\"text-decoration-none\" href=\"https://twitter.com/\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                                                <i class=\"flaticon-twitter\"></i>\r\n                                            </a>\r\n                                        </li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n                                </li>\r\n                            </ul>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>', '1', 999, 14, '2023-10-16 21:34:21', '2024-09-01 13:43:14'),
(129, 4, 'heroarea', 'Hero Area', '<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" \r\n height=\"50px\">\r\n  <!-- Embedding an image -->\r\n  <image xlink:href=\"https://test.webfire.in/public/admin/theme/img/user.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" />\r\n</svg>', '{class : \'\',id:\'\'}', '<div class=\"hero-area\">\r\n            <div class=\"container-fluid\" data-cues=\"slideInUp\" data-disabled=\"true\">\r\n                <div class=\"hero-content\" data-cue=\"slideInUp\" data-show=\"true\" style=\"animation-name: slideInUp; animation-duration: 600ms; animation-timing-function: ease; animation-delay: 0ms; animation-direction: normal; animation-fill-mode: both;\">\r\n                    <div class=\"title\">\r\n                        <h1>A World-Classes Education For Your Better life</h1>\r\n                        <p>We are a Top 06 Canadian university and one of the Top 120 in the world. Find out what makes our student experience so rich, meaningful and life-changing.</p>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-unstyled ps-0 mb-0 hero-btn\">\r\n                        <li class=\"d-inline-block\">\r\n                            <a class=\"text-decoration-none default-btn\" href=\"university-overview.html\">\r\n                                Take A Tour\r\n                                <i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow\"></i>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                        <li class=\"d-inline-block\">\r\n                            <a class=\"text-decoration-none arrow-btn\" href=\"program-details.html\">\r\n                                View Our Programs\r\n                                <i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow\"></i>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"hero-reviews\" data-cue=\"slideInUp\" data-show=\"true\" style=\"animation-name: slideInUp; animation-duration: 600ms; animation-timing-function: ease; animation-delay: 0ms; animation-direction: normal; animation-fill-mode: both;\">\r\n                    <p class=\"everything\">“Everything that I learned at Adma University really helped put me above the competition”.</p>\r\n                    <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\r\n                        <div class=\"user d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                            <div class=\"image\">\r\n                                <img src=\"assets/img/hero/hero-1.jpg\" alt=\"hero-user\">\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                <h6>John Smith</h6>\r\n                                <span>Adma’s student</span>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"quote-icon\">\r\n                            <i class=\"flaticon-quote\"></i>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>', '1', 999, 14, '2023-10-16 21:34:21', '2024-09-01 13:43:14'),
(130, 4, 'aboutarea', 'About Area', '<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" \r\n height=\"50px\">\r\n  <!-- Embedding an image -->\r\n  <image xlink:href=\"https://test.webfire.in/public/admin/theme/img/user.jpg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" />\r\n</svg>', '{class : \'\',id:\'\'}', '<div class=\"about-area pt-100 pb-75\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\" data-cues=\"slideInUp\" data-disabled=\"true\">\r\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-6\" data-cue=\"slideInUp\" data-show=\"true\" style=\"animation-name: slideInUp; animation-duration: 600ms; animation-timing-function: ease; animation-delay: 0ms; animation-direction: normal; animation-fill-mode: both;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"about-image\">\r\n                            <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/about/about-1.jpg\" alt=\"about-image\">\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-6\" data-cue=\"slideInUp\" data-show=\"true\" style=\"animation-name: slideInUp; animation-duration: 600ms; animation-timing-function: ease; animation-delay: 0ms; animation-direction: normal; animation-fill-mode: both;\">\r\n                        <div class=\"about-content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"title\">\r\n                                <h2 class=\"d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/title-shape.svg\" alt=\"title-shape\">\r\n                                    About Adma University\r\n                                </h2>\r\n                                <p>At Adma, we believe in providing an exceptional educational experienc that prepares students for success in an ever-changing world. As a leading institution of higher learning, we are committed to fostering a vibrant academic community and empowering our students to reach their full potential. We are committed to fostering a vibrant academic community and empowering our students to reach their full potential.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <a class=\"text-decoration-none arrow-btn\" href=\"university-overview.html\">\r\n                                University Overview\r\n                                <i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow\"></i>\r\n                            </a>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>', '1', 999, 14, '2023-10-16 21:34:21', '2024-09-01 13:43:14'),
