></li>\r\n                                                <li class=\"d-inline-block\"><i class=\"flaticon-star-1\"></i></li>\r\n                                            </ul>\r\n                                            <p>Universities value students who can think critically and solve problems. Reviewers may assess a student\'s ability to analyze information, evaluate different perspectives, and apply logical reasoning to arrive at solutions. Many university programs involve group projects or collaborative activities.</p>\r\n                                            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\r\n                                                <div class=\"user d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"image\">\r\n                                                        <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/testimonial/testimonial-6.jpg\" alt=\"testimonial-image\">\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                    <div class=\"content\">\r\n                                                        <h3>Jessica Clark</h3>\r\n                                                        <span>Adma’s student</span>\r\n                                                    </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                                <div class=\"quote-icon\">\r\n                                                    <i class=\"flaticon-quote\"></i>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                            <div class=\"thumbs-arrow d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between\">\r\n\r\n                                <div class=\"next-prev-arrow d-flex align-items-center\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"next\">\r\n                                        <i class=\"flaticon-left-arrow\"></i>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                    <div class=\"prev\">\r\n                                        <i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow\"></i>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                                <div thumbsSlider=\"\" class=\"swiper testimonial\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"swiper-wrapper justify-content-end\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-item-image\">\r\n                                                <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/testimonial/testimonial-3.jpg\" alt=\"testimonial-image\">\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-item-image\">\r\n                                                <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/testimonial/testimonial-4.jpg\" alt=\"testimonial-image\">\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-item-image\">\r\n                                                <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/testimonial/testimonial-5.jpg\" alt=\"testimonial-image\">\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"testimonial-item-image\">\r\n                                                <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/testimonial/testimonial-6.jpg\" alt=\"testimonial-image\">\r\n                                            </div>\r\n                                        </div>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- End Testimonial Area -->\r\n\r\n        <!-- Start Partner Area -->\r\n        <div class=\"partner-area pb-75\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"partner-slider-info\">\r\n                    <div class=\"swiper partner-slider\">\r\n                        <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\" data-cues=\"slideInUp\">\r\n                            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                <div class=\"single-partner-logo\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/partner/partner-1.png\" alt=\"partner-logo\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                <div class=\"single-partner-logo\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/partner/partner-2.png\" alt=\"partner-logo\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\r\n                                <div class=\"single-partner-logo\">\r\n                                    <img src=\"/public/theme/college/assets/img/partner/partner-3.png\" alt=\"partner-logo\">\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n      