puter Labs\r\n                                </h3>\r\n                                <p>Computer labs equipped with computers, printers, and software are available for students to work on assignments.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"facilities-info\">\r\n                                <h3>\r\n                                    <span>02.</span>\r\n                                    Performing Arts Centers\r\n                                </h3>\r\n                                <p>Universities with performing arts programs often have dedicated facilities such as theaters, concert halls, and rehearsal spaces.</p>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                           <div class=\"d-inline-block\">\r\n                                <a class=\"text-decoration-none default-btn\" href=\"application.html\">\r\n                                    Application Form\r\n                                    <i class=\"flaticon-right-arrow\"></i>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                           </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- End Facilities Area -->\r\n\r\n        <!-- Start Application Area -->\r\n        <div class=\"application-area pt-100 pb-75\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <div class=\"application-section-title\">\r\n                    <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-sm-7\">\r\n                            <div class=\"application-title\">\r\n                                <h2>How To Apply At Adma</h2>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-sm-5\">\r\n                            <div class=\"application-btn d-flex justify-content-end\">\r\n                                <a class=\"text