(136, 15, 'Muahini', 'The Dance of Duality\r\n\r\nInspired by the delicate balance of nature and self, Muahini is an exquisite attar that comes in a unique duo—two bottles, each designed to enhance the individual experience of your left and right wrist. This harmonious pairing captures the essence of balance and duality, making every moment of application a personal ritual.Top Notes: The journey begins with the soothing embrace of lavender entwined with woodsy notes, evoking the tranquility of a twilight forest. The subtle floral sweetness of lavender calms the senses, while the rugged woodsy aroma provides grounding energy, creating a serene and comforting opening.Middle Notes: As Muahini unfolds, the heart reveals a luxurious blend of vanilla and cardamom. Vanilla introduces warmth and a gentle sweetness, while cardamom adds an exotic, spicy touch. This combination offers a rich, enticing layer that lingers with a smooth and elegant complexity.Base Notes: The base is a deep, mystical blend of herbal tones, rich oud, and velvety sandalwood. This grounding foundation gives Muahini its long-lasting presence, with the herbal notes adding freshness, oud bringing depth, and sandalwood enhancing the scent\'s creamy, woody richness.Together, the dual bottles allow you to create a symphony of scents—each wrist revealing its own nuance, yet harmonizing into one. With Muahini, embrace the beauty of duality, where every wrist tells its own story, yet together they create a melody of serenity, warmth, and sophistication.This introduction highlights the dual-bottle concept while weaving in the unique blend of notes for a luxurious and evocative experience. Let me know if you\'d like any changes!', '/public/temp/21/1725953910.jpeg', 'Get Quote', '', '2024-09-10 07:40:06', '2024-09-10 07:40:06', 21),
(137, 15, 'Deeva', 'Deeva: A Fragrance of Grace and Radiance\r\n\r\nUnveil the essence of elegance with Deeva, a luxurious attar that encapsulates beauty and sophistication in every drop. Housed in a single exquisite bottle, Deeva opens with a vibrant bouquet of fruity top notes—luscious strawberry, bold blackcurrant, and crisp red apple—an irresistible invitation to a fragrant journey. \r\n\r\nAt its heart, Deeva blooms with the delicate allure of sweet pea, jasmine, and rose, weaving a floral tapestry that exudes softness and feminine grace. As the scent settles, the warmth of raspberry melds with the creamy richness of sandalwood and the deep embrace of amber, leaving a lasting impression of sensuality and depth.\r\n\r\nDeeva is more than a fragrance; it’s a celebration of radiant femininity, perfect for the woman who commands attention with grace.\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\nDoes this fit your vision, or would you like any changes?', '/public/temp/21/1725954036.jpeg', 'Get Quote', '', '2024-09-10 07:41:20', '2024-09-10 07:41:20', 21),
(138, 15, 'Riveir Kochar Jeevan', '', '/public/temp/21/1725954107.jpeg', 'Get Quote', '', '2024-09-10 07:42:00', '2024-09-10 07:42:00', 21),
