;&lt;div class=&quot;fun-fact__count counter&quot;&gt;318&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;fun-fact__text&quot;&gt;Media Posts&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;ixdzg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;izlti&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.decorpot.com/images/blogimage1361284108interior-designs-for-master-bedroom.jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ibi09&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iit86&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;ijpuj&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; Unique Intrior&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ilnbh&quot;&gt;At unique interior2012, we prioritize budget management and efficient scheduling, ensuring every design project exceeds expectations. Our team expertly handles product ordering, coordination, and installation, maintaining everything needed for your space. Our aim is to craft innovative solutions that perfectly balance functionality and aesthetics, guaranteeing client satisfaction.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Our team at unique interior2012 comprises globally-selected consultants, renowned for their unique skills in turnkey interior fit-outs. Utilizing advanced CAD and 3D systems, alongside a vast library of modern finishes and fittings, we consistently deliver world-class interior solutions. Our commitment to excellence extends beyond project completion, ensuring lasting client service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot; id=&quot;i3b2i&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;iz6zr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot; id=&quot;iom5g&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;inv07&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Vision&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ihse72&quot;&gt;unique interior2012 envisions itself as a global leader in innovative design and turnkey fitouts. We are dedicated to offering top-quality services, marked by a blend of creativity and efficiency. Our focus is on delivering unparalleled solutions that redefine interior spaces.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i5cfmm&quot;&gt;Our commitment extends to providing exceptional customer service. This fundamental principle drives us to exceed expectations in every project. We aim to set new standards in the design and execution of turnkey fitouts, ensuring each client receives the best in the industry&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 4, '1', '2024-08-18 07:23:07', '2024-08-18 09:15:28');
