024 | Recognized by Govt of India | Top Awarded Winning Institute | Practical / Live Projects Instructor-led Certified Summer Industrial Training in Lucknow | 100% Practical Based Summer Training | Qualify for Industrial Training Certificate &amp;amp; Develop a Promising Career after Industrial Training\n                                                    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ig2gm1&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot; id=&quot;iju0h&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mitech.thememove.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/mitech-box-image-style-01-image-02-100x108.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;il7m2h&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;ikxocb&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Apprenticeship&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;iny2r&quot;&gt;These days the education scenario has entirely changed. Students are not getting adequate practical knowledge due to which the quality of education has gone low resulting in the increased rate of unemployment. The industry has number of jobs Industry do not have right candidate to grab that opportunity.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ix2szf&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;izndhv&quot; class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mitech.thememove.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/mitech-box-image-style-01-image-03-100x108.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ih99qq&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 id=&quot;ichecw&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Internship&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;iufsvi&quot;&gt;After the completion of first year of the Programme, students in the month of May and June undertake two months summer internship in their preferred area of specialization in any corporate organization. The objective of summer internship is to help students relate the concepts learned in class with practice in real life situations, make them aware of business practices and instill a sense of discipline in them. It is mandatory training for all students and is equivalent to two full courses.\n                                                    &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;circle-arrow&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;middle-dot dot-2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-arrow-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon End --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iors6m&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ht-box-images style-01&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ido4r4&quot; class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mitech.thememove.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/mitech-box-image-style-01-image-03-100x108.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot