gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;izu7fr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;idwhz2&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://austinvisuals.com/wp-content/uploads/Austin-Visuals-is-the-top-animation-explainer-video-company.png&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;if5nqp&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iclujs&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ig4d6n&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;ixr04j&quot;&gt;Welcome to&lt;/span&gt; Multi State Cooperative Society&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ik3zkq&quot;&gt;Crystal Consultancy was formed to help our clients for registration of multi state cooperative society. We deal in services related to various categories of multi state cooperative societies whether it is credit, housing, construction, solar, agro, transport, hospital, conversion of credit society into multi state or any other multi state cooperative society. Our proposals are formulated after painstaking research and detailed study of the client’s range of activities. We at Crystal Consultancy have a wide range of professionals to render precise support to our valued clients across the country. These professionals are supported by appropriate office infrastructure and an exhaustive database of support documentation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;id9y0n&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Read More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot; id=&quot;ibbbbz&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iot1to&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;iz14yr&quot;&gt;Our &lt;/span&gt;Team&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i42iuz&quot;&gt;The firm is consultant to 500+ clients and is backed by highly qualified and trained experts having germane experience. It’s a 10 members firm including three retired Bank officers of Nationalised Bank. The vast practice expands around cooperative societies and other special assignments with leading banks, public sectors and private sectors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/page/About-Us&quot; id=&quot;iki958&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Know More&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.nibblevideo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/ALL-11-04-1.png&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i2jliw&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1vqaeo&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=48]	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--============ Infotechno Hero Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--============ Infotechno Hero End ============--&gt