--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iaxrqx&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;iasth&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;is5ug&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; EBima Bazar&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;ifky2&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;EBima Bazar&lt;/strong&gt;, we are dedicated to simplifying your insurance needs by offering a wide range of tailored solutions under one roof. Our mission is to provide accessible and affordable insurance options that protect what matters most to you—your health, life, assets, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With a deep understanding of the evolving insurance landscape, our experienced team is committed to helping you make informed decisions. Whether you are looking for health, motor, life, or business insurance, we ensure that our services are straightforward, transparent, and customized to fit your specific needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;At EBima Bazar, our goal is to be your trusted insurance partner, guiding you every step of the way with expertise, efficiency, and a customer-first approach.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 8, '1', '2024-08-23 08:31:05', '2024-08-23 12:21:37');
