estimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iv4alz&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3s1zs&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://biteable.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/Healthcare01.gif&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ih3bff&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iq2exq&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i3q0d1&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ig1kqf&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; CraftCure&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie4awl&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;CraftCure is a sole proprietorship firm doing exceptional work in the field of medical industry by offering immaculate range, which is highly trusted. We established ourselves in the medical industry in the year 2008 for supplying and trading of extensive range of medical equipment which includes orthosis supporters and braces for various body parts.  We are accredited for the developments taking place in the industry with the support of recent technology. The entire range gives complete assertion to the client about its accuracy in results. Our products are receiving enormous appreciation for their performance. The range offers exceptional operation life with very low maintenance making patrons very happy. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;isnwxf&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;idglf6&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;irbpkz&quot; class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot;&gt;Why Choose &lt;/span&gt;Us ?&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i3wskk&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Our patrons are very contented with the way we have been conducting business in market and the simple motive behind is our aim to satisfy our end-users. We make sure the consumers get the best quality beyond any doubt. In order to facilitate stress-free delivery of products, we have been able to establish an outstanding distribution network which ensures to resolve all apprehension of our esteemed patrons regarding procurement of finished products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iptc8q&quot; class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;blog-list-large-image.html&quot; id=&quot;ijsiq9&quot; class=&quot;ht-btn ht-btn-md&quot;&gt;Call Now!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://videoigniter.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Medical-Animation-Animated-Video.png&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;iip6h6&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 11, '1', '2024-08-30 07:08:29', '2024-09-03 11:04:11'),
