lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ikh18c&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i04yg5&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;iwlkdj&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i614yi&quot;&gt;Our Mission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ir86pb&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;We at New Steps Consulting are working on a noble mission of creating a new India with the right guidance and counseling for existing and upcoming generations. &lt;br/&gt;Our career expert team will help children to know their potential and suitable career options available for them.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwh9wf&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;iffovh&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;izh4yi&quot;&gt;Our Vision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ieuuzd&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;The main aim is to make parents and individuals to know that “everyone is born original and there is no need to live a life being a copy of someone.” We have unique and most reliable career selection and growth programs based on:&lt;br/&gt;Cognitive psychology / Embryo science&lt;br/&gt;Neuroscience / Dermatoglyphics&lt;br/&gt;Pediatric psychology / Genetics&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1zuk2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot