;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#i5q32{text-decoration:underline;}#iju3b3{margin:0px 0px 0px 1px;}#ir7tdm{color:#000000;font-size:30px;font-family:Courier New, Courier, monospace;}#ixf24h{font-weight:normal;}#ilykpa{font-family:Impact, Charcoal, sans-serif;}#ib5ypa{height:400px;width:100%;}@media (max-width: 480px){#ib7x1i{margin:0px 0px 0px 23px;}#ihqh32{margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;}}', '&lt;style id=&quot;vvvebjs-styles&quot;&gt;&lt;/style&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i5mg&quot; class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;swiper-notification&quot; aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i7v5kj&quot;&gt;[AB-Slider id=112]&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;icknel&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;it1ej3&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://thebrim.webfire.site/public/temp/14/1725271994.jpg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ilz27h&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;il6ql7&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i2azqr&quot;&gt; The Brim&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i0qy2f&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i5nnj3&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i3vs9h&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffc000&quot; id=&quot;ibdzsx&quot;&gt;An Initiative of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ziyanex.com/indra/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; id=&quot;i5q32&quot;&gt;INDRA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ir58w8&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;The Founder spent most of his teenage years sulking about what he is not. He had esteem issues; he used to feel that he is not good enough. Negative emotions were so natural to him that they had impacted the way he interacted with himself and others. When he started his career as a public speaker, which definitely is a hell of a journey in itself. And, today he is regarded as one of the inspirational speakers and Emotional well-being coach amongst his audience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6ny5y&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iycc9w&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://thebrim.webfire.site/public/temp/14/1725696980.jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i4za0o&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i08ud&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iik6h&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;imd52j&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot; id=&quot;ic6a9&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i0ntzv&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;i1kmi&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i9d8vv&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Mr. Prashant Mishra&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i7a0ap&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ixf632&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iurhdc&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i7luc&quot;&gt;The Founder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ifol6g&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;Prashant Mishra stands at the intersection of creativity, empathy, and leadership. With a diverse portfolio that spans across authorship, counseling, blogging, and voice artistry, Prashant has established himself as a thought leader and a guiding force in the industry. His work empowers individuals and organizations alike, driving meaningful change and fostering innovation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ifdzj&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iam6o&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Authorship and Thought Leadership&lt;br id=&quot;itnk7&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i19to4&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As an author, Prashant delves deep into the human experience, exploring themes that resonate with readers across the globe. His writings are a testament to his understanding of the complexities of life and the challenges faced by individuals and organizations. Through his books and articles, Prashant provides valuable insights and practical advice, making a lasting impact on his audience.&lt;br id=&quot;i8byk&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br id=&quot;ijdc7&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;is3944&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i5863j&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;span draggable=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;igeo7j&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counseling and Empowerment&lt;br draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iq9fpq&quot;&gt;Prashant’s role as a counselor is marked by his ability to connect with people on a profound level. He offers guidance to those seeking clarity and direction in their personal and professional lives. His empathetic approach and deep understanding of human behavior make him a trusted advisor, helping individuals unlock their potential and achieve their goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br draggable=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;igoz2z&quot;&gt;&lt;br draggable=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;ih9nf5&quot;&gt;&lt;span draggable=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;ispwtp&quot;&gt;Blogging and Digital Influence&lt;br draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;imtgdo&quot;&gt;As a blogger, Prashant shares his expertise and experiences with a global audience. His blog serves as a platform for thought-provoking discussions, offering readers valuable perspectives on various topics. Through his digital presence, Prashant has built a community of like-minded individuals who are inspired by his words and motivated to pursue their aspirations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Empowering Organizations and Start-Up Incubation&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prashant’s commitment to empowering organizations is evident in his work with businesses and startups. He provides strategic guidance and support, helping companies navigate challenges and achieve sustainable growth. His expertise in start-up incubation has been instrumental in nurturing innovative ideas and turning them into successful ventures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Events, Talk Shows, and Voice Over Services&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prashant is also a seasoned speaker and voice artist, bringing his dynamic presence to events and talk shows. His ability to engage audiences and deliver impactful messages has made him a sought-after speaker in various forums. Additionally, his voice-over work adds a unique dimension to his portfolio, showcasing his versatility and creativity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Services Offered&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Authorship: Writing and publishing insightful books and articles.&lt;br&gt;Counseling: Offering personal and professional guidance.&lt;br&gt;Blogging: Sharing knowledge and experiences through digital content.&lt;br&gt;Organizational Empowerment: Providing strategic advice for businesses and startups.&lt;br&gt;Start-Up Incubation: Supporting the growth of innovative ventures.&lt;br&gt;Events and Talk Shows: Engaging audiences with impactful speeches.&lt;br&gt;Voice Over: Delivering professional voice-over services for various projects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ihqh32&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i7by9l&quot; class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ilxy13&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;id5338&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;inxiir&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;il1o11&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot; id=&quot;izk5k&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ib5esl&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i id=&quot;iaovf&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iw5vaf&quot;&gt;Mrs. Sanjana Misra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iegz2i&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sanjana Misra:&lt;/b&gt; A Dedicated Educator and Skilled Trainer with a Passion for Language and Literature&lt;br id=&quot;i5z4pl&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br id=&quot;ixr5by&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Sanjana Misra is a seasoned educator and trainer with an impressive track record in teaching, training, and curriculum design. With a solid academic foundation and extensive professional experience, Sanjana has made significant contributions to the educational landscape, particularly in the realms of English language and literature. Known for fostering supportive learning environments and enhancing students&#039; academic journeys, Sanjana continues to impact lives positively through her dedication and expertise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i2zway&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-left mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://thebrim.webfire.site/public/temp/14/17256903561.jpg&quot; width=&quot;726&quot; height=&quot;435&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;itwzsc&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ib9io9&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iqi052&quot; class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ioff0j&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ibkybo&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;izkac&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Academic Background&lt;br id=&quot;i47tfk&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;idgrvq&quot;&gt;Sanjana began her academic journey at the University of Calcutta, where she earned a Bachelor&#039;s degree in Commerce in 1998. Building on this foundation, Sanjana pursued a Master of Arts in English from the University of Allahabad, graduating in 2006. Her linguistic proficiency includes fluent command of English, Hindi, and native Bengali, which enhances her ability to connect with diverse student populations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Professional Experience&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sanjana’s career in education spans over two decades, marked by a commitment to teaching and training. Her professional trajectory includes significant roles at various institutions:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sir Padamapat Singhania Education Center, Kanpur (2021 - 2023): As a Teacher and Trainer, Sanjana focused on teaching English and Social Studies while imparting training for PI (Personal Interview) and GD (Group Discussion) sessions. She also led content design for training programs and developed specific sessions for SSB (Services Selection Board) candidates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Speakwel, Kanpur (Feb 2010 - Present): In her role as a Teacher and Trainer, Sanjana has been instrumental in delivering verbal training sessions and designing tailored training programs for diverse audiences. Her efforts in this position reflect her dedication to improving communication skills and professional preparedness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Santan Dharm Education Centre, Kanpur (2023 - Present): Currently serving as a Teacher, Sanjana continues to educate and inspire students in English, focusing on high school curricula while managing literary activities as the Incharge of the Literary Club.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Trinity Education Center (2001 - 2003): At this institution, Sanjana taught English for Class 12th and Economics for Class 10th, showcasing her versatility and commitment to academic excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Services Offered&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sanjana Misra offers a range of specialized services designed to support students and professionals in their academic and career development:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;English Language and Literature Instruction: Comprehensive teaching of English language and literature for classes 9th to 12th, focusing on enhancing language skills, literary analysis, and critical thinking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Verbal and Communication Training: Tailored verbal training sessions aimed at improving communication skills, including public speaking, presentation techniques, and effective interpersonal communication.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Personal Interview (PI) and Group Discussion (GD) Coaching: Expert guidance for personal interviews and group discussions, essential for academic and professional advancement, including strategies for effective participation and presentation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SSB (Services Selection Board) Preparation: Customized training sessions for SSB candidates, covering interview techniques, group exercises, and personality assessment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Curriculum Design and Content Development: Leading the design and development of educational content and training programs, ensuring relevance and engagement for diverse learner groups.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Literary Activity Management: Overseeing and organizing literary activities, including managing literary clubs and coordinating events that foster students&#039; literary interests and talents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trainings and Certifications&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sanjana has pursued various certifications and trainings to enhance her teaching and training skills. She is an Infosys Certified Trainer and has completed Senior Teachers Training from David Hare College of Correspondence. Additionally, she has participated in CBSE Workshops, further solidifying her expertise in the educational field.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Professional Goals&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sanjana is driven by the goal of establishing and maintaining strong relationships with students, parents, and colleagues to create a supportive learning community. Her commitment to ensuring that every student achieves their full potential is a testament to her dedication as an educator. Through tailored training programs, innovative teaching methods, and a focus on individualized support, Sanjana aims to continue making a significant impact in the educational sector.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Conclusion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With a rich background in education, extensive training experience, and a passion for fostering academic growth, Sanjana Misra stands out as a remarkable educator and trainer. Her contributions to teaching English and literature, coupled with her commitment to professional development and student success, underscore her exceptional role in shaping the future of education.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ihxoo1&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i58wv9&quot; class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://thebrim.webfire.site/public/temp/14/17256903562.jpg&quot; width=&quot;950&quot; height=&quot;782&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ieu6fl&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;il7vc3&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6vgdi&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ix3orl&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iu9xuq&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iej4z&quot;&gt;About&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ivs9vs&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;idof3h&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ipz7lg&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ffc000&quot; id=&quot;ispwqn&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ziyanex.com/indra/&quot; id=&quot;i805kg&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;INDRA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iil8ku&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;At NGO for INDRA, we believe in the power of community and the transformative impact of collective action. Our mission is to create sustainable development and empower marginalized communities through education, healthcare, and economic opportunities. We are dedicated to fostering a society where every individual has access to the resources they need to lead a dignified life.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i9yfad&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iyjckw&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Education: &lt;/b&gt;Providing quality education to children and adults, ensuring that knowledge and skills are accessible to all. We support schools, offer scholarships, and run vocational training programs to equip individuals with the tools they need for a better future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Healthcare: &lt;/b&gt;Ensuring that everyone has access to essential healthcare services. We organize medical camps, support local clinics, and promote health awareness campaigns to improve the overall well-being of the communities we serve.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Economic Empowerment: &lt;/b&gt;Creating economic opportunities through microfinance, skill development, and entrepreneurship programs. We empower individuals to become self-reliant and financially stable, fostering economic growth within the community.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Environmental Sustainability: &lt;/b&gt;Promoting sustainable practices and environmental conservation. We educate communities about the importance of preserving natural resources and support initiatives that protect the environment for future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iigwbi&quot;&gt;[AB-Gallery id=103]	&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ifxc9b&quot; class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ib7x1i&quot; class=&quot;col-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images__serven&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quo