(67, 77, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#ivlufm{font-size:18px;color:black;}#irpqtf{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#ioo2cn{font-size:18px;color:black;}#iwmav1{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#i49bko{color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-size:14px;}#iw1y58{color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-size:14px;}#i0ugz3{color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-size:14px;}#i8ntev{color:rgb(105, 105, 105);font-size:14px;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwmav1&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;in2agw&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Franchise &amp;amp; Freelancer&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;iqrh5&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;i90wnc&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;DMIT Franchise&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ivlufm&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;The Edtech industry is a $120 billion market. It happens to be one of the fastest-growing industries in today’s time. This makes it the most favorable time to enter this market.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If you want to own a DMIT franchise in India, you can rely on NS Consulting. With us, you get a chance to be a part of this major revolution and earn high ROI from your business.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If you are serious about setting up a DMIT business, give us a message. Our team will get back to you shortly.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is a franchise?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;A franchise or franchising can be defined as a method of distributing services or products involving a franchisor, who establishes the brand’s trade name, a franchisee, and a business system, that pays royalties and fees for the right to do business under the name of the franchisor.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Franchising is considered to be a leading business method. For your information, around 41% of all retail businesses in the world are franchised operations and are expected to grow in the next decade.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why to choose DMIT franchise?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;More people are choosing franchising over other forms of business because of obvious benefits. Franchise offers a proven method of operation that allows the franchisee to capitalize on the expertise and experience of an already established organization. This ensures peace of mind even when they are starting a new business.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The increased privatization of education has opened new opportunities for franchise businesses in this field. Several big brands felt the need to reach out to a large mass of people, which ultimately aided the idea of a franchise.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Quality and believability are two of the most important variables in the field of education. Thus, running an established educational brand appears to be a superior choice over building a new one.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The education industry is a leading sector in India. So if you are planning to invest in a business, getting an education franchise might be a good idea.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why NS Consulting franchise?&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;NS Consulting services are both high-quality and result-oriented. We are the largest DMIT franchise company in India. You can contact us to become a part of our franchise and set up your own business. By combining our resources with your hard work and entrepreneurial spirit, you can run a successful business and get a high ROI. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We offer a unique DMIT franchise opportunity, where you can enjoy a rewarding business relationship with us. Contact us to enquire about DMIT franchise cost. Our team will guide you with everything you need to know.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;We offer different types of DMIT franchise in India. These include:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i49bko&quot;&gt;* &lt;/span&gt;Unit Franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iw1y58&quot;&gt;* &lt;/span&gt;Master Franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i0ugz3&quot;&gt;* &lt;/span&gt;Area Franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i8ntev&quot;&gt;* &lt;/span&gt;Regional franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;There are so many reasons people rely on NS Consulting for DMIT software franchise. We aim to provide a mutually beneficial relationship to our clients.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Brand&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;When it comes to DMIT, we allow individuals to promote their brand. This is an important thing if you want to run the business long-term. This gives you repeat business and helps you to establish a successful brand value of your own.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Product&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;In this case, the product is a service. People rely on us because we offer a quality service. Our DMIT software franchise is the best. Unlike other companies, we don’t pass on this software by copy-pasting. We are a 100% genuine company. Talk to us and invest in our franchise only if you are content.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Support&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Every company claims to provide the best support, but only a handful of them stick true to their words. We are proud to admit that we offer complete support to our clients. From how to conduct the DMIT test to how to answer the queries of parents, our team will guide you with everything you want. Apart from that we also offer marketing support so you can set up a successful business with our help.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;For all of the above reasons, our clients are very satisfied with us. We stick to our claims and the promises we make. We understand the importance of our client’s trust, and we wouldn’t do anything to let them down.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Whether you are looking for DMIT franchise in Pune or Bangalore, we are present in all the big cities in India. All you have to do is contact us, and we can take it from there.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Benefits of NS Consulting Franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The major benefits of taking a DMIT franchise from NS Consulting are many.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;We offer the best and most effective DMIT software franchise in the country.&lt;br/&gt;Our product ensures 100% activation results.&lt;br/&gt;Our DMIT test franchise is affordable.&lt;br/&gt;We have an experienced team to assist you whenever you need them.&lt;br/&gt;Once you get the DMIT software franchise from us, we don’t charge any upgradation fee. &lt;br/&gt;We offer lifetime membership with no renewal charges.&lt;br/&gt;You can avail of free lifetime training support from us.&lt;br/&gt;We offer lifetime digital media marketing support for free.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;DMIT Franchise&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;You will come across numerous companies offering DMIT franchise in India. But if you want the best DMIT test franchise at an affordable rate, then you should contact NS Consulting.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;DMIT software franchise is used to determine the inborn intelligence and potential of an individual through fingerprints. We offer DMIT Software that generates DMIT Reports. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Our DMIT software has two parts: Frontend and Backend. The front end includes the output format of the DMIT report, consisting of design, color, images, and number of pages in the report, layout, branding, etc. The backend defines the algorithm and parameters used in the DMIT test. This includes the number of fingerprint patterns, ease of use for DMIT software, and the accuracy of the DMIT report. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;You may get similar DMIT Test reports in terms of color and design, but they will have different results due to differences in the backend algorithm. When selecting DMIT software, accuracy matters the most.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;At NS Consulting, we offer the best DMIT franchise cost in India. Our software is genuine and result-oriented. If you are determined to own a DMIT franchise business, you should get in touch with our team. They will guide you through the whole process and also help you with the marketing part.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ic2hj9&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap layout-section-bg section-space--pt_120 section-space--pb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;irpqtf&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;Freelance with us&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ioo2cn&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Be Your Own Boss&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Freedom to Work whenever you want&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Start your journey as an entrepreneur. India’s great revolution of empowering millions of youth with our latest technologies and the right guidance&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 15, '1', '2024-09-03 08:28:36', '2024-09-07 10:42:07');
