 highways, local routes and other facilities. Which also acts as a guide for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You don&#039;t have to wait in our platform. Our services like car rental, near me taxi, cab for outstation, luxury car rental near me, are available 24×7 days. After booking our cab, you don&#039;t need to go to other taxi providers as that taxi is yours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Customer service is paramount at Solo Cabs. There is no extra charge in solo cabs. It provides you better facilities like outstation cabs and car rental service at cheap prices. If you want to have a pleasant journey then do not worry at all.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Because Solo Cabs has many options of taxi service near me. Which turns your ride into a happy ride. Solo Cabs provides both local and online outstation cab services. Along with this, we provide services like budget car rentals, outstation cabs, car rental, online outstation cab in better and cheaper prices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;izzbfo&quot; class=&quot;footer-preview section-space--ptb_120 prv-section-footer-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i0ikqp&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12 col-md-12 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;footer-preview-content section-space--ptb_70 text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;ifnrhn&quot; class=&quot;heading text-white&quot;&gt;Book Your Best Cab For Your journey!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;heading text-white mt-25&quot;&gt;A High-growth Approach&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;header-button downlode-btn mt-40&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wa.me//+9193298577