--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;i9w9us&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;iwybjh&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;i9hcm6&quot;&gt;About Subrat Financial &amp;amp; Insurance Services&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i0fzgi&quot;&gt;At Subrat Financial &amp;amp; Insurance Services, we are committed to ensuring that every household is financially protected through our comprehensive range of insurance and financial products. Founded by Subrat Sahoo, our firm offers Life Insurance, Health Insurance, Motor Insurance, and Mutual Funds, all designed to meet the unique needs of each individual and family.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;With years of expertise and a client-first approach, we aim to make insurance accessible, simple, and reliable for everyone. Whether you&#039;re safeguarding your family&#039;s future, protecting your health, or securing your assets, our team is here to guide you every step of the way.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our mission is clear: &lt;/b&gt;to ensure that no one faces financial difficulties, providing peace of mind and a safety net for life&#039;s uncertainties. Our vision is to see every household financially secure, with each member insured, creating a foundation for stability and prosperity.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Join us in securing your future today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;iwz2h&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;*Mission: &lt;/b&gt;&quot;To provide comprehensive insurance and financial solutions that protect every individual in every household, ensuring financial security and peace of mind through life, health, motor insurance, and mutual funds.&quot;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;*Vision: &lt;/b&gt;&quot;To build a future where every household is financially secure, with each member insured, eliminating the risk of financial distress and creating a foundation of stability and growth for all.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 20, '1', '2024-09-10 06:16:23', '2024-09-10 06:17:32'),
