= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;ibia76&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;i9o7h9&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;Contact Information&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;im28e6&quot;&gt;We’d love to hear from you! Whether you have questions about our attars, need help with your order, or just want to share your experience with Riveir Kochar, we’re here to assist you. Your feedback and inquiries are important to us, and our team is ready to provide you with the best support possible. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;ilm2zb&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1nye&quot;&gt;[ab-form id=165]\n&lt;style&gt;\n#i1xp7p &gt; form &gt; div.row &gt; div {\n    background: #110944;\n    color: white;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n}\n.rendered-form.formbuilder-embedded-bootstrap .btn, .rendered-form.formbuilder-embedded-bootstrap .form-control {\n    background-image: none;\n    width: 100%;\n}\n.rendered-form &gt; div {\n    text-align: left;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n}\n&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i12mp&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Address:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;Riveir Kochar 1220 Lawrence 2150 Wentworth, MO&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;iv6gk&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;iymii&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact No. :&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;iffpl&quot;&gt;For any questions, concerns, or suggestions, please reach out to us via phone or email, and we’ll get back to you as soon as possible. Thank you for choosing Riveir Kochar—we look forward to connecting with you! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n          &lt;!-- JS\n    ============================================ --&gt;\n    &lt;!-- Modernizer JS --&gt;\n    \n\n    &lt;!-- jQuery JS --&gt;\n    \n    \n\n    &lt;!-- Bootstrap JS --&gt;\n    \n\n    &lt;!-- Plugins JS (Please remove the comment from below plugins.min.js for better website load performance and remove plugin js files from avobe) --&gt;\n\n    \n\n    &lt;!-- Main JS --&gt;\n    \n        \n    \n          \n        \n\n        &lt;!-- AB gallery  --&gt;\n        \n        \n    &lt;!-- AB gallery  --&gt;\n        &lt;!-- AB SLIDER  --&gt;\n     &lt;!-- Include Slick JavaScript --&gt;\n    \n\n    \n    &lt;!-- AB SLIDER  --&gt;\n    \n    ', 21, '1', '2024-09-10 06:58:37', '2024-09-10 07:06:30');
