(91, 104, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#ij2hx{transform:translate3d(-372px, 0px, 0px);transition-duration:0ms;}#iltu3{width:342px;margin-right:30px;}#i68dy{visibility:visible;}#itxqq{width:342px;margin-right:30px;}#i7iir{visibility:visible;}#iwxvl{width:342px;margin-right:30px;}#i8zki{visibility:visible;}#ijnv6{width:342px;margin-right:30px;}#iu4v1{visibility:visible;}#iinqlc{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#it3l6{width:100px;height:100px;}#i9ezh{width:100px;height:100px;}#ir9xr{width:100px;height:100px;}#i11ei{text-align:justify;}#io2qs{text-align:justify;}#il0mwp{text-align:justify;}', '&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iinqlc&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;ihzvzp&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;Testimonials&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ib4o&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider-area section-space--ptb_120&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section-title-wrap text-center section-space--mb_40&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;section-sub-title mb-20&quot;&gt;Testimonials&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container testimonial-slider__container swiper-container-initialized swiper-container-horizontal&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ij2hx&quot; class=&quot;swiper-wrapper testimonial-slider__wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;iltu3&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-duplicate swiper-slide-prev&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i68dy&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;assets/images/testimonial/mitech-testimonial-avata-01-90x90.webp&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Abbie Ferguson&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;designation&quot;&gt;WEB DESIGNER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;I’ve been working with over 35 IT companies on more than 200 projects of our company, but @Mitech is one of the most impressive to me.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;0&quot; id=&quot;itxqq&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-active&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i7iir&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://rivier.webfire.site/public/temp/21/17259523571.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;it3l6&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;i2oeu&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Ally Arguello&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;io2qs&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;i’m so thrilled I discovered AƩars by Riveir Kochar! From the moment I &lt;br/&gt;opened the beauƟfully designed box, I knew I was in for something special. &lt;br/&gt;The boƩles are absolutely stunning—sleek, elegant, and they feel so &lt;br/&gt;luxurious to hold. But the real magic is in the scents. Each aƩar has its own &lt;br/&gt;unique, capƟvaƟng fragrance that makes me feel confident and beauƟful all &lt;br/&gt;day long. It’s amazing how just a few drops can last for hours, and I love that &lt;br/&gt;they’re alcohol-free and so gentle on the skin. I’m so happy I decided to try &lt;br/&gt;Riveir Kochar—it’s a total game-changer in my daily rou&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;1&quot; id=&quot;iwxvl&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide swiper-slide-next&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i8zki&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://rivier.webfire.site/public/temp/21/1725952357.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;i9ezh&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;ihjdr&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Ally plassman&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i11ei&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;As a woman who’s always on the go, I was so surprised by Riveir Kochar’s &lt;br/&gt;attars. I’ve never been big on fragrances, but this brand has changed my mind &lt;br/&gt;completely. The scents are elegant yet subtle, perfect for everyday wear &lt;br/&gt;without being too strong. And when you mix the black and gold (Sundara) on &lt;br/&gt;opposite sides of the wrist and blend together you get a burst of extra beauty &lt;br/&gt;that comes alive! It’s definitely unique! I love how long-lasting they are, they &lt;br/&gt;keep me feeling beautiful and confident all day. Plus, the beautiful bottles &lt;br/&gt;add a touch of class to my dresser. Riveir Kochar has truly made me a fan—&lt;br/&gt;these attars are now a must-have in my rouutine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-swiper-slide-index=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;ijnv6&quot; class=&quot;swiper-slide&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iu4v1&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__one wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider--info&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__media&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://rivier.webfire.site/public/temp/21/17259523572.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ir9xr&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-slider__author&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;testimonial-rating&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fa fa-star&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;author-info&quot;&gt;&lt;h6 id=&quot;ia1idl&quot; class=&quot;name&quot;&gt;Haliie Lowery &lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;il0mwp&quot; class=&quot;testimonial-slider__text&quot;&gt;Riveir Kochar has redefined my experience with fragrances through their &lt;br/&gt;exceptional range of attars. Each scent—whether it’s the elegant Sundara, the&lt;br/&gt;divine Deeva, or the vibrant Muahini—reflects a masterful blend of tradition &lt;br/&gt;and innovation. First time when I saw the two perfume bottles together in a &lt;br/&gt;box, I liked the idea but I was little confused but then I decided to buy those &lt;br/&gt;because bottles were so pretty, the moment I hold it in my hands I didn’t &lt;br/&gt;want to leave them, I was excited for that,  when I actually applied it and I &lt;br/&gt;felt the sweet fresh aroma in the whole room, everywhere I go that was with me &lt;br/&gt;and I felt so happy, I definitely recommend it to all&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-t01 section-space--mt_30 swiper-pagination-clickable swiper-pagination-bullets&quot;&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 1&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet swiper-pagination-bullet-active&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 2&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 3&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span tabindex=&quot;0&quot; role=&quot;button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Go to slide 4&quot; class=&quot;swiper-pagination-bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span aria-live=&quot;assertive&quot; aria-atomic=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;swiper-notification&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--========== Call to Action Area End ============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 21, '1', '2024-09-10 07:08:55', '2024-09-10 08:11:14'),
(92, 103, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}#ij2v6c{color:black;}#it4umy{font-size:20px;color:black;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;}#id6m7x{color:#d10000;}#i24l3z{color:black;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;font-size:20px;}#ihohg{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#ipygd8{color:#e30000;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot; id=&quot;ihohg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot; id=&quot;iwdgv&quot;&gt;About &lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;ircssf&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;ij2v6c&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-color-primary&quot; id=&quot;ipygd8&quot;&gt;About &lt;/span&gt; Riveir Kochar*&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;it4umy&quot;&gt;With nearly 20 years of expertise in the cosmetics and beauty industry, Riveir Kochar has become a name synonymous with luxury, authenticity, and craftsmanship. Our commitment to excellence is reflected in every attar we create, using only the finest natural ingredients, including real flowers, herbs, and spices, free from any alcohol or synthetic additives. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot; id=&quot;ixx8ru&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot; id=&quot;il2x89&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading&quot; id=&quot;id6m7x&quot;&gt;The Making of Riveir Kochar Attars&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;text mt-30&quot; id=&quot;i24l3z&quot;&gt;Each attar is crafted using a traditional hydro-distillation process that captures the pure essence of natural botanicals. Real flowers and plant materials are simmered gently in water within traditional copper vessels, allowing their aromatic oils to be extracted without losing their delicate nuances. The resulting essence is then aged in natural sandalwood oil, enhancing the fragrance’s depth and longevity. This meticulous, time-honored process results in a luxurious, intimate scent that evolves beautifully on the skin, offering a sensory experience that is both refined and timeless.&lt;br id=&quot;iejnd&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;&lt;br id=&quot;irmkg&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;At Riveir Kochar, we blend the art of ancient perfumery with modern elegance, creating attars that are not just fragrances but expressions of beauty and heritage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 21, '1', '2024-09-10 07:22:28', '2024-09-10 07:29:36'),
(93, 101, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#i4jeru{font-size:20px;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;color:black;text-align:justify;}#igvye{margin:0 0 0 0px;}#i0w7p{color:#e80000;}#i1651p{visibility:visible;}#ien9vx{visibility:visible;}#isnirx{visibility:visible;}#i8il0x{visibility:visible;}#i112dc{margin:0px 0px 0px 23px;}#ix71lh{width:100%;}#i25u24{width:100%;}#immqci{width:100%;}#in2lui{width:100%;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-wrap banner-space about-us-bg&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;igvye&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-8 m-auto&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;about-banner-content text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 id=&quot;ickks&quot; class=&quot;mb-15 text-white&quot;&gt;What is Attar?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-large-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Resources Wrapper End ===========--&gt;&lt;!--========= About Delivering Wrapper Start ===========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper Start ==========--&gt;&lt;!--=========== fun fact Wrapper End ==========--&gt;&lt;!--====================  testimonial section ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of testimonial section  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  brand logo slider area ====================--&gt;&lt;!--====================  End of brand logo slider area  ====================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area Start =================--&gt;&lt;!--============ Contact Us Area End =================--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i9glfh&quot; class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4jeru&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;i0w7p&quot;&gt;Attar, also known as **ittar*, &lt;/b&gt;is a traditional, natural perfume made from the distillation of flowers, herbs, spices, woods, and other botanical materials. Unlike conventional perfumes, attars are ethyl alcohol-free and oil-based, making them highly concentrated, long-lasting, and suitable for direct application on the skin.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; it’s a journey into the heart of tradition, a tribute to the ancient art of attar-making. Unlike modern perfumes, which often rely on synthetic carriers like ethyl alcohol to disperse their scent, Riveir kochar remains true to its roots. Crafted using time-honored techniques passed down through generations, our attar is made without using of ethyl  alcohol. In place of synthetic agents, we use natural oils that allow the fragrance to unfold slowly, lasting longer on your skin and creating a personal, intimate aura.The creation of riveir kochar is a labor of love, using the traditional method of hydro-distillation, where the essence of flowers, herbs, and woods is gently extracted, preserving their purity and depth. Each drop of our products is imbued with this care, resulting in a rich, complex fragrance that tells a story as it evolves on your skin.The Fragrance Profile:Top Notes: The first encounter with riveir kochar Sundara is fresh and spicy, evoking the vibrancy of nature at dawn.Heart Notes: As it settles, warm and woody spices emerge, grounding the fragrance in a sense of ancient earthiness.Base Notes: Finally, it lingers with a powdery oud, leaving a trail of deep, mystical elegance.Sundara celebrates the art of slow beauty, where each element is in harmony with nature, and the fragrance resonates with your unique chemistry. It is a reminder of the beauty that comes from patience, craftsmanship, and tradition—an experience that only a true attar can provide.Experience the essence of Sundara: a beautiful woman, an eternal fragrance, a work of art.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid ps-0 pe-0&quot; id=&quot;i4y7nz&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row no-gutters&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-12&quot; id=&quot;i112dc&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images__three modern-grid-image-4 row no-gutters&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-3 col-md-6&quot;&gt;&lt;!-- ht-box-icon Start --&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#&quot; class=&quot;ht-box-images style-03 wow move-up animated&quot; id=&quot;i1651p&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;image-box-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;box-image&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://rivier.webfire.site/public/temp/21/17259573923.jpeg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ix71lh&quot; class=&quot;img-fulid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;!-- ht-b